{"id":"d3d99e3b153bda99","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-prop-ultrapower-elementary.md","title":"Łoś Theorem for an Ultrapower","display":"prop-ultrapower-elementary — Łoś Theorem for an Ultrapower","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-ultrapower-elementary","aliases":["58-prop-ultrapower-elementary"],"display":"prop-ultrapower-elementary — Łoś Theorem for an Ultrapower","depends_on":["[[58-df-ultrapower]]","[[58-df-ultraproduct]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-ultrapower-elementary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-ultrapower-elementary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ultrapower-elementary — Łoś Theorem for an Ultrapower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"58-df-ultrapower\">58-df-ultrapower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"77610c949b2c174a\" href=\"?note=77610c949b2c174a\" title=\"58-df-ultraproduct\">58-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-structure with universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is a nonempty index set, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is an ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_i=\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M_i=\\mathcal M\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^I/U\\coloneqq\\prod_U\\mathcal M_i\">\\(\\mathcal M^I/U\\coloneqq\\prod_U\\mathcal M_i\\)</span> is the constant-family ultraproduct structure.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> is the variable set; assignments of representatives are functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to M^I\">\\(a:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to M^I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> and the coordinate maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(i)\">\\(E(i)\\)</span> are explicitly bound below, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(f)=[f]_U\">\\(q(f)=[f]_U\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(i)(f)=f(i)\">\\(E(i)(f)=f(i)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists q,E,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\n\\operatorname{Val}_U,\\operatorname{Sat}_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M^I/U,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,M^I,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M^I/U))\n\\land\\forall f\\in M^I\\;(q(f)=[f]_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,I,M^{M^I})\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall f\\in M^I\\;(E(i)(f)=f(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathcal M^I/U,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_U,\\operatorname{Sat}_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathrm{Var}_S,M^I)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_U(\\varphi,q\\circ a)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,E(i)\\circ a)\\}\\in U\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists q,E,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\n\\operatorname{Val}_U,\\operatorname{Sat}_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M^I/U,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,M^I,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M^I/U))\n\\land\\forall f\\in M^I\\;(q(f)=[f]_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,I,M^{M^I})\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall f\\in M^I\\;(E(i)(f)=f(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathcal M^I/U,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_U,\\operatorname{Sat}_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathrm{Var}_S,M^I)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_U(\\varphi,q\\circ a)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,E(i)\\circ a)\\}\\in U\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\left[\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\right]\n\\to\\exists d\\in V\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,M,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M^I/U))\n\\land\\forall a\\in M\\;\\bigl(d(a)=[\\langle a:i\\in I\\rangle]_U\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(d,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M^I/U)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\left[\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\right]\n\\to\\exists d\\in V\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,M,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M^I/U))\n\\land\\forall a\\in M\\;\\bigl(d(a)=[\\langle a:i\\in I\\rangle]_U\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(d,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M^I/U)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first assertion is Łoś's equivalence for every formula code and a full variable assignment of representatives. The quotient map, coordinate-evaluation maps, and both satisfaction recursions are selected explicitly; no undeclared arity operator or raw satisfaction primitive remains.</li>\n<li>The second assertion binds the diagonal map as a genuine set function before asserting elementarity; no completeness or nonprincipality assumption on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrapower]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"77610c949b2c174a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_i=\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M^I/U\\coloneqq\\prod_U\\mathcal M_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathrm{Var}_S\\to M^I","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"E(i)","display":false},{"tex":"q(f)=[f]_U","display":false},{"tex":"E(i)(f)=f(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists q,E,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\n\\operatorname{Val}_U,\\operatorname{Sat}_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M^I/U,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,M^I,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M^I/U))\n\\land\\forall f\\in M^I\\;(q(f)=[f]_U)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(E,I,M^{M^I})\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall f\\in M^I\\;(E(i)(f)=f(i))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathcal M^I/U,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_U,\\operatorname{Sat}_U)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathrm{Var}_S,M^I)\\to\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_U(\\varphi,q\\circ a)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\{i\\in I:\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,E(i)\\circ a)\\}\\in U\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\left[\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=M\n\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\right]\n\\to\\exists d\\in V\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(d,M,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M^I/U))\n\\land\\forall a\\in M\\;\\bigl(d(a)=[\\langle a:i\\in I\\rangle]_U\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(d,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M^I/U)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":3176,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4009","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-prop-ultrapower-elementary.md|58-prop-ultrapower-elementary]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["80d22bbd3f726e33","77610c949b2c174a","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","d9b8711cda3f31ca","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","36d7463d215be751","a25c0a66cf56c0f4"]}